      "review_description": "MDB was one of the 3 solar installers recommended through SolarQuotes. At first, we were a little hesitant. We wanted to support a small local business but they had less reviews than the others. However, they offered a really good system (one we were hoping for) for a competitive price and Marco (the owner) came across as genuine and professional during my interactions with him.It was the best decision and we have been so pleased with Marco and his team from first contact to installation. There was no pressure or hard sell tactics. Marco was easy to contact when we had questions. Professional and efficient from start to finish, they made the whole process easy, smooth and straightforward.Marco sent a quote after a conversation on the phone where I gave him details about my home. After informing him that we wanted to go ahead (pre-deposit), he sent his team to check our home, roof and electrical set up. Then, he gave us detailed information about how our solar system will be set up (there were a few complications and limitations due to the age and layout of our block of units) before we set the installation date and paid the deposit. On the day of installation, Marco’s team were friendly, punctual, hardworking and efficient. No roof tiles were damaged or broken, which was a bonus. One of the electricians helped me install the app and showed me the system after.Thank you to Marco and the team at MDB. It was a great experience all round and we would not hesitate to recommend them to anyone who asks.",
